<title>USA: CIT Group names Spector CEO of credit finance unit.</title>
<headline>CIT Group names Spector CEO of credit finance unit.</headline>
<dateline>LIVINGSTON, N.J. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIT Group Tuesday said Sharon Spector was named president and chief executive of CIT Group/Credit Finance, reporting to Joseph Pollicino, CIT vice chairman.</p>
<p>Spector had been most recently senior executive vice president of CIT's Commercial Services unit. She replaces Drew Neidorf who resigned.</p>
